  "title_en": "Xi Jinping Returns to Beijing After State Visit to North Korea",
  "summary_zh": "6月9日下午，中共中央总书记、国家主席习近平在圆满结束对朝鲜国事访问后回到北京。",
  "summary_en": "On the afternoon of June 9, General Secretary and President Xi Jinping returned to Beijing after completing a state visit to North Korea.",
